OL,3,GNEWSAPair helped hundreds of mothers
OL,4,Aget back into work
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo women from Bristol who have helped
OL,7,Fhundreds of mothers back into work have
OL,8,Fspoken about the joy their jobs give
OL,9,Fthem.
OL,11,FCamilla Rigby and Rachel Mostyn set up
OL,12,FWomen's Work Lab (WWL) in 2019, after
OL,13,Fseeing the challenges faced by mothers
OL,14,Ftrying to get back into the workplace
OL,15,Fafter having children.
OL,17,FSince then, more than 800 women have
OL,18,Fused the organisation's services to
OL,19,Fgrow their confidence, learn new skills
OL,20,Fand find employment.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
